// Copy this file to ios/Config/Signing.xcconfig to sign the App Store build (an archive for TestFlight or the App Store).
// ios/Config/Signing.xcconfig is ignored by git. Only the owner of the paid Apple Developer Program account of the app needs it.
// Only Release builds read it: with a team here, Xcode signs the Release build automatically with that team.
// With no team here, the Release build signs by hand with no team, so Xcode refuses to sign it and registers nothing.

// The Team ID of the paid team that owns io.github.valfur03.trome (10 letters and digits).
// Never put a free Personal Team here: Xcode would register io.github.valfur03.trome to it, and the paid account could not take it for a week or more.
// Your own builds on your iPhone use DEVELOPMENT_TEAM in ios/Config/Local.xcconfig instead.
TROME_RELEASE_TEAM =
